     1,
     "\r\n<font face=\"verdana\" size=\"2\"><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Dear all,</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">We are excited to offer an <strong>online Introductory Geometric Morphometrics course</strong> on <strong>3–5 February </strong>.\r\n This course covers the essentials of data acquisition, quality control,\r\n and basic analysis in 2D and 3D geometric morphometrics, using \r\neasy-to-use software and practical hands-on sessions. It’s ideal for \r\nbeginners and researchers seeking a solid foundation.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Course website:<a href=\"https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/course22/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" title=\"This external link will open in a new window\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/course22/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792483151765000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Kd2aZL1OyJsBrPFRWLreB\">https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/course22/</a> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">For those interested in more advanced analyses, we also offer the companion course:</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong>Multidimensional Phenotypic Evolution</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"> <strong>2–6 March </strong>(online)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">This\r\n advanced course explores techniques for analyzing multidimensional \r\ntraits—including geometric morphometric and non-morphometric data—at \r\nmicro- and macroevolutionary scales. It includes more complex \r\nstatistical approaches and practical sessions using R and graphical \r\ntools.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Both\r\n courses are taught by Dr. Carmelo Fruciano (University of Catania, \r\nItaly) and form a complementary learning pathway from data acquisition \r\nto in-depth phenotypic analysis.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Course website: <a href=\"https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/mpe/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" title=\"This external link will open in a new window\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/mpe/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792483151765000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2korKMpC0_X4JMZA3s8J-g\">https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/mpe/</a> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Feel free to contact us for more details.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Best regards,</span><br><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"> Carlo</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:trebuchet ms;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">--------------------</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Carlo Pecoraro, Ph.D</span><br><br><br><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Physalia-courses DIRECTOR</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">in...@physalia-courses.org</a></span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">mobile: <a href=\"tel:+49%20176%2045230846\" value=\"+4917645230846\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+49 17645230846</a></span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/physaliacourses.bsky.social\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" title=\"This external link will open in a new window\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://bsky.app/profile/physaliacourses.bsky.social&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792483151765000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1fJMIBVm62E-zJuaAjHuna\">Bluesky</a> <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/physalia-courses-a64418127/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" title=\"This external link will open in a new window\" target=\"_